    {
      "title": "Olympics Database | Data Engineer",
      "dropdowns": [
        {
          "title": "Skills",
          "icon": "fa-solid fa-lightbulb",
          "iconColor": "#F4D03F",
          "items": [
            { "name": "Database Design", "color": "#00008B" },
            { "name": "SQL", "color": "#00008B" },
            { "name": "PL/SQL", "color": "#00008B" },
            { "name": "MongoDB", "color": "#00008B" },
            { "name": "Relational Database", "color": "#00008B" },
            { "name": "Non-Relational Database", "color": "#00008B" },
            { "name": "SQL Query Optimization", "color": "#00008B" },
            { "name": "DML and Transaction Management", "color": "#00008B" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Summary",
          "icon": "fa-solid fa-align-left",
          "iconColor": "#E67E22",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "<div class=\"summary-container\">\n  <div class=\"summary-text\">\n    <p> I developed a robust database system for Paris Arrow Transit (PAT) to manage transportation logistics for events like the Olympics. I worked across both relational and non-relational databases, leveraging SQL, PL/SQL, and MongoDB to build a flexible and efficient system. My work involved not only creating and populating the database to meet specified requirements but also implementing advanced features such as sequence management and data integrity enforcement through triggers and stored procedures. I restructured the schema to accommodate new business rules, including managing official roles and handling complaints about drivers' behavior. The system was designed to automatically suspend drivers based on accumulated demerit points and ensure that all trip-related data adhered to business logic. Additionally, I integrated MongoDB to handle driver-trip data in JSON format, adding another layer of scalability to the project. Throughout, I ensured that the database was efficient, scalable, and aligned with future needs.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"summary-media\">\n    <img src=\"images/software/Olympics_Database/Olympic_Logical.png\" alt=\"Olympics Database\" />\n  </div>\n</div>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Links",
          "icon": "fa-solid fa-link",
          "iconColor": "#9B59B6",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "<a href=\"https://github.com/jabichebli/olympicsDatabase.git\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n  <i class=\"fa-brands fa-github\"></i> Github Repository\n</a>\n <a href=\"https://jabichebli.github.io/olympicsDatabase/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n  <i class=\"fa-brands fa-github\"></i> Github Page (Demo)\n</a>\n"
