            "items": [
              {
                "text": "<div class=\"summary-container\">\n  <!-- Left: Text Content -->\n  <div class=\"summary-text\">\n    <p>\n      I created an interactive game designed to simulate space waste management, raising awareness about environmental issues related to human waste in space. This project aimed to engage users in a fun way while educating them on the importance of proper space waste management.<br><br> The game works by having the user control a spaceship, moving it left and right using the arrow keys, and shooting lasers to destroy incoming space debris with the space bar. As the user progresses, the debris moves faster and in greater quantities. They earn points for every piece of debris destroyed.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Right: Images -->\n  <div class=\"summary-media\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; height: auto;\">\n    <img src=\"images/software/Garbage_Shooter/Garbage_Shooter.png\" alt=\"Garbage Shooter Game\" style=\"transform: rotate(90deg) translate(0px, -50px); max-width: 100%; padding-top: 100px; \">\n  </div>\n</div>"
